/**
 * @mainpage Programming Project I - Conference Assignment Tool
 *
 * @section intro Introduction
 * Tool for assigning paper submissions to reviewers at scientific conferences,
 * formulated as a Maximum Flow problem using the Edmonds-Karp algorithm.
 *
 * @section structure Project Structure
 * - **parser** — reads and parses the input CSV dataset
 * - **graph_builder** — constructs the max-flow network
 * - **edmondsKarp** — computes the maximum flow
 * - **generate_assignments** — extracts assignments from the flow solution
 * - **risk_analysis** — identifies critical reviewers
 * - **output_writer** — writes results to CSV
 * - **pipeline** — orchestrates the full workflow
 * - **menu** — interactive command-line interface
 *
 * @section authors Authors
 * - Nuno Gonçalves
 * - Raquel Silva
 */